[OC]|cffffffffThe Deadmines|r  -  group of 5, finder level 16, bosses 19-21
[OC][A Hunter] |cffffcc00In a group:|r pet on passive, Growl OFF (the tank holds threat), send it only at the tank's target and pull it back before the next pack; Concussive Shot or Wing Clip a runner rather than chasing it. Feed the pet before you zone in.
[OC]|cffffcc00Pre-dungeon quest log:|r
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r The Defias Brotherhood (166) - VanCleef's head - |cff66ff66normal|r
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Red Silk Bandanas (214) - 10 from Defias inside - |cff66ff66normal|r, drops from most Defias trash; everyone gets their own
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Collecting Memories (168) - 4 Miners' Union Cards - |cff66ff66normal|r, from the undead in the tunnel before the instance (each player loots their own)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Oh Brother (167) - Foreman Thistlenettle's badge - |cff66ff66normal|r, he is a level 20 elite in the tunnel; one badge per kill, so kill him once per group member or just once if only you have it
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Underground Assault (2040) - Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from Sneed's Shredder - |cff66ff66normal|r, 100%, everyone can loot it
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Destruction in Deadmines (92753) - plant the explosives at the forge (Gilnid's foundry) - |cff66ff66normal|r
[OC]Starts inside: An Unsent Letter (VanCleef's drop, 870 XP in Stormwind)
[OC]|cffffcc00Not for you:|r My First Alchemy Set is optional side stuff (herbalists only; the Captain Sanders treasure hunt is an [O] chain on the Westfall south loop, chapter 05)

[OC]Run to Moonbrook. While the group gathers:
